## A lock's `Mutex`/`SharedSync` poison marker. Carries no data — its
## presence in an `Err(PoisonError)` is the whole signal. The explicit
## `init` lets the ergonomic `lock`/`into_inner` wrappers in `mutex.rx`
## construct one via `PoisonError.new` (an empty class body declares no
## constructor, so `.new` would otherwise be rejected).
class PoisonError
  def init
  end
end
